@startuml order-state
!theme plain
title #141 故障单主状态机 A（fault_tickets.status，9 态 / 15 规则条目·16 图边 / 2 终态）

[*] --> AI_CANDIDATE_PENDING : A1 (巡检员/管理员建候选)
[*] --> PENDING_DISPATCH : A2 (纯人工报障)
AI_CANDIDATE_PENDING --> PENDING_DISPATCH : A3 (确认 → 分级快照 + 48h)
AI_CANDIDATE_PENDING --> CANCELLED : A4 (巡查员否定误报)
PENDING_DISPATCH --> CANCELLED : A5 (派工前撤销)
PENDING_DISPATCH --> DISPATCHED : A6 (管理员派工)
DISPATCHED --> IN_REPAIR : A7 (维修员接单)
DISPATCHED --> PENDING_DISPATCH : A8 (维修员拒单/超时，或拒单达阈值→MANUAL_REVIEW)
DISPATCHED --> MANUAL_REVIEW : A8 (累计拒单 ≥3)
IN_REPAIR --> PENDING_ACCEPTANCE : A9 (维修完工 + 电气安全检查)
IN_REPAIR --> MANUAL_REVIEW : A10 (维修员 escalate)
PENDING_ACCEPTANCE --> CLOSED : A11 (巡查员 APPROVED)
PENDING_ACCEPTANCE --> REWORK_PENDING_DISPATCH : A12 (巡查员 REJECTED，round_no <= 2)
PENDING_ACCEPTANCE --> MANUAL_REVIEW : A13 (巡查员 REJECTED，round_no > 2)
REWORK_PENDING_DISPATCH --> DISPATCHED : A14 (新轮派工，同 A6)
MANUAL_REVIEW --> PENDING_DISPATCH : A15 (APPROVE_REASSIGN)
MANUAL_REVIEW --> CLOSED : A16 (SPECIAL_CLOSE，reason ≥10 字)
MANUAL_REVIEW --> CANCELLED : A17 (TERMINATE_CANCEL)
@enduml
